## 🎮 Welcome to Open Source HTML5 Games

**Open Source HTML5 Games** is a hub for discovering browser-based gaming projects built with open web technologies. Explore the creative side of **HTML5, CSS, and JavaScript**, from simple arcade concepts to more ambitious interactive experiences.

Whether you're a player looking for something fun or a developer searching for inspiration, HTML5 games offer a convenient way to discover how interactive experiences can be built for the browser.

> 💡 **Why HTML5 games?** The web is a flexible platform for creativity. Games can combine visuals, controls, audio, animation, and game logic using technologies familiar to web developers.

