## 🧠 Tips for Players & Developers

<table align="center" width="100%">
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

**🎮 For players**

- Try an updated browser for modern web features.
- Check on-screen controls before starting.
- Use headphones when a game includes sound.
- Review the requirements for each title.

</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top">

**💻 For developers**

- Start with smaller projects to learn game loops.
- Inspect keyboard, mouse, and touch controls.
- Experiment with Canvas rendering and animation.
- Check each project's license before reusing code or assets.

</td>
</tr>
</table>

